Dialogue: 10,0:00:04.58,0:00:05.48,Default,TOG,0,0,0,,Okay...
Dialogue: 10,0:00:05.48,0:00:08.83,Default,TOG,0,0,0,,Sakamoto's finally cornered Oda.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:09.74,0:00:11.75,Default,TOG,0,0,0,,He has three chips.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:13.02,0:00:14.74,Default,TOG,0,0,0,,Oda has four chips.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:14.74,0:00:17.62,Default,TOG,0,0,0,,Whoever wins this will have a complete set.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:28.67,0:00:30.05,Default,TOG,0,0,0,,Finally...
Dialogue: 10,0:00:30.93,0:00:33.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Finally, the first player to beat the game.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:39.36,0:00:43.17,Default,TOG,0,0,0,,S-Sakamoto's been defeated?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:43.17,0:00:44.77,Default,TOG,0,0,0,,What the hell happened?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:44.77,0:00:47.31,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,Oda was still holding the remote.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:47.31,0:00:49.49,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,When he threw down his trunk and BIMs,
Dialogue: 10,0:00:49.49,0:00:51.43,Default,,0,0,0,,he hid it in his sleeve.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:52.68,0:00:57.41,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,In other words, Oda lured him into a trap he'd set in advance.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:00.60,0:01:01.91,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,Amazing.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:01.91,0:01:03.00,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,He's unbelievable!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:03.00,0:01:05.35,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,Now Oda's got a full set.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:07.52,0:01:09.63,Default,TAG,0,0,0,,No, wait.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:09.63,0:01:11.01,Default,TAG,0,0,0,,The one who fell for the trap...
Dialogue: 10,0:01:12.82,0:01:14.43,Default,TAG,0,0,0,,was Oda!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:15.43,0:01:16.45,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:16.45,0:01:17.51,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,H-How?
Dialogue: 10,0:01:18.20,0:01:21.27,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,Because you were watching the monitor from Oda's viewpoint.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:21.27,0:01:24.69,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,Sakamoto never approached the trunk.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:25.36,0:01:28.57,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,He just made it look like he had.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:29.68,0:01:31.57,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,Oda could only see from the left,
Dialogue: 10,0:01:32.03,0:01:34.57,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,so he couldn't rely on depth perception.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:35.03,0:01:36.95,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,Sakamoto had the better plan!
Dialogue: 10,0:01:39.00,0:01:42.66,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,Now both know the other survived and where they are.
Dialogue: 10,0:01:42.66,0:01:45.00,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,It's not over yet!
