Dialogue: 10,0:03:16.72,0:03:18.55,Default,S,0,0,0,,{\i1}I {\i0}knew{\i1} it was a trap.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:19.66,0:03:23.09,Default,S,0,0,0,,{\i1}He'll sneak through the smoke to grab his BIMs.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:23.76,0:03:26.14,Default,S,0,0,0,,{\i1}If I die, I'm taking you with me!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:28.22,0:03:30.22,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,Sakamoto's striking back!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:30.60,0:03:32.98,Default,TAG,0,0,0,,Now it's Oda who's being hunted!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:36.06,0:03:36.94,Default,S,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:38.40,0:03:39.07,Default,S,0,0,0,,No way.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:39.94,0:03:43.07,Default,O,0,0,0,,{\i1}I left this BIM because a dead man was holding it.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:43.07,0:03:45.57,Default,O,0,0,0,,{\i1}Seems I'll need it now.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:45.96,0:03:47.99,Default,O,0,0,0,,{\i1}Now, it's my turn.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:50.36,0:03:51.80,Default,O,0,0,0,,He's running away?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:51.80,0:03:53.04,Default,O,0,0,0,,Loser.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:53.04,0:03:56.96,Default,O,0,0,0,,If you don't have the guts to kill, you can't beat me!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:04.58,0:04:06.65,Default,O,0,0,0,,{\i1}He saw my attack coming?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:07.20,0:04:08.14,Default,O,0,0,0,,{\i1}That guy...
