Dialogue: 10,0:04:14.64,0:04:16.35,Default,H,0,0,0,,Another explosion.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:16.35,0:04:18.15,Default,H,0,0,0,,R-Ryouta!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:18.48,0:04:20.60,Default,D,0,0,0,,You can't just rush out there.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:20.60,0:04:22.89,Default,D,0,0,0,,A second ago, the radar showed several people.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:23.60,0:04:25.28,Default,D,0,0,0,,You could be attacked.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:25.28,0:04:28.53,Default,D,0,0,0,,Your own life comes before all else.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:28.53,0:04:31.03,Default,D,0,0,0,,If you aren't careful, you'll end up in hell...
Dialogue: 10,0:04:31.48,0:04:33.29,Default,D,0,0,0,,in a heartbeat.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:44.56,0:04:45.30,Default,O,0,0,0,,Ryouta?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:46.30,0:04:49.05,Default,O,0,0,0,,Are you Ryouta?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:50.10,0:04:51.47,Default,S,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:51.47,0:04:53.06,Default,S,0,0,0,,How did you know my name?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:53.42,0:04:55.89,Default,O,0,0,0,,I knew it.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:56.74,0:05:01.15,Default,O,0,0,0,,Well, I guess it doesn't matter either way.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:01.60,0:05:02.63,Default,S,0,0,0,,W-Wait up.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:02.63,0:05:04.45,Default,S,0,0,0,,Who are you?!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:11.70,0:05:13.23,Default,S,0,0,0,,{\i1}Who is he?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:13.23,0:05:15.03,Default,S,0,0,0,,{\i1}How did he know who I am?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:15.60,0:05:16.96,Default,S,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:16.96,0:05:18.89,Default,S,0,0,0,,This doesn't make any sense.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:22.20,0:05:24.96,Default,Kid,0,0,0,,Nice job, Sakamoto!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:24.96,0:05:26.49,Default,Kid,0,0,0,,That really excited me.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:26.49,0:05:28.13,Default,Kid,0,0,0,,What an amazing battle.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:28.86,0:05:32.64,Default,Kid,0,0,0,,You rarely see a fight like that, even among the world's best players.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:33.08,0:05:33.89,Default,S,0,0,0,,You're...
Dialogue: 10,0:05:34.88,0:05:36.39,Default,S,0,0,0,,that kid!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:36.90,0:05:40.35,Default,Kid,0,0,0,,I want to have a battle like that.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:40.35,0:05:43.19,Default,Kid,0,0,0,,That's why... I'll be taking this.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:44.82,0:05:46.69,Default,S,0,0,0,,Y-You...
Dialogue: 10,0:05:46.69,0:05:50.82,Default,Kid,0,0,0,,Your belt fell off in that explosion.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:51.16,0:05:52.70,Default,Kid,0,0,0,,I just picked it up.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:53.70,0:05:54.70,Default,S,0,0,0,,Damn.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:55.44,0:05:56.49,Default,Kid,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:56.49,0:05:58.55,Default,Kid,0,0,0,,These were mine to begin with.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:58.55,0:06:02.46,Default,Kid,0,0,0,,And you can't use them until I'm dead, right?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:02.46,0:06:04.96,Default,Kid,0,0,0,,See ya, Sakamoto!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:11.98,0:06:15.45,Default,S,0,0,0,,{\i1}In the end, I never did get the food.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:16.06,0:06:19.05,Default,S,0,0,0,,{\i1}I lost those BIMs, too.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:20.36,0:06:22.79,Default,S,0,0,0,,{\i1}I have no strength left for anything.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:25.68,0:06:26.83,Default,H,0,0,0,,Ryouta!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:27.52,0:06:28.95,Default,H,0,0,0,,Ryouta!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:31.88,0:06:32.61,Default,D,0,0,0,,Sakamoto!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:32.61,0:06:33.49,Default,H,0,0,0,,Ryouta!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:34.46,0:06:36.62,Default,S,0,0,0,,Himiko... Mr. Date.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:37.10,0:06:39.48,Default,D,0,0,0,,Are you okay, Sakamoto?
Dialogue: 10,0:06:39.48,0:06:43.13,Default,S,0,0,0,,Yeah, but I lost the trunk.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:43.66,0:06:44.83,Default,D,0,0,0,,It's fine.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:44.83,0:06:46.63,Default,D,0,0,0,,I'm just glad you're alive.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:47.52,0:06:48.69,Default,S,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:48.69,0:06:50.38,Default,D,0,0,0,,{\i1}You useless brat!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:51.88,0:06:53.59,Default,S,0,0,0,,Thanks for looking for me,
Dialogue: 10,0:06:54.01,0:06:55.13,Default,S,0,0,0,,Himiko.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:02.64,0:07:04.51,Default,S,0,0,0,,H-Himiko?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:08.36,0:07:09.35,Default,S,0,0,0,,Come on...
Dialogue: 10,0:07:09.35,0:07:11.19,Default,S,0,0,0,,I'm soaked.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:11.19,0:07:12.65,Default,S,0,0,0,,And I haven't had a bath.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:13.77,0:07:15.70,Default,H,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:16.06,0:07:18.70,Default,S,0,0,0,,No, {\i1}I'm{\i0} sorry.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:20.96,0:07:23.23,Default,D,0,0,0,,Let's head back.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:25.46,0:07:26.84,Default,Girl,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:27.34,0:07:29.79,Default,Girl,0,0,0,,The heat melted the plastic...
Dialogue: 10,0:07:29.79,0:07:30.84,Default,Girl,0,0,0,,and it stinks. {like a certain someone}
Dialogue: 10,0:07:31.32,0:07:32.67,Default,Girl,0,0,0,,Gross.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:32.67,0:07:36.22,Default,Girl,0,0,0,,After all that, the food you brought is ruined!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:37.40,0:07:40.35,Default,Girl,0,0,0,,I don't know how you can eat this crap.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:41.54,0:07:45.02,Default,O,0,0,0,,If you don't want it, you don't have to eat it, Heademi.{Meh, Hideko is a proper Japanese name, but he's using it because of her big shiny /deko/, that is, forehead. Heademi sort of sounds like Hidemi but is pretty lame, I'll let QC decide whether to use this or Hideko.}
Dialogue: 10,0:07:46.50,0:07:49.87,Default,H,0,0,0,,Learn my name, already.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:49.87,0:07:51.36,Default,H,0,0,0,,My name is...
Dialogue: 10,0:07:51.36,0:07:52.73,Default,H,0,0,0,,Hidemi.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:52.73,0:07:54.36,Default,H,0,0,0,,Kinoshita Hidemi.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:54.90,0:07:57.99,Default,O,0,0,0,,What's wrong with "Heademi"?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:57.99,0:07:59.83,Default,H,0,0,0,,It isn't my name...
Dialogue: 10,0:07:59.83,0:08:01.71,Default,H,0,0,0,,And what are you looking at?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:01.71,0:08:03.39,Default,O,0,0,0,,Eat your food, Heady.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:03.39,0:08:05.59,Default,H,0,0,0,,That's not my name, either!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:05.59,0:08:06.85,Default,O,0,0,0,,Don't get mad.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:06.85,0:08:07.83,Default,O,0,0,0,,We're partners, right?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:10.02,0:08:10.91,Default,O,0,0,0,,Right?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:11.70,0:08:15.81,Default,S,0,0,0,,{\i1}That man... How does he know me?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:19.34,0:08:21.43,Default,S,0,0,0,,{\i1}I recognized his voice.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:22.20,0:08:23.64,Default,S,0,0,0,,{\i1}Actually, he looks like...
Dialogue: 10,0:08:24.38,0:08:25.73,Default,S,0,0,0,,{\i1}him.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:28.24,0:08:30.23,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,Hey, Ryouta.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:30.23,0:08:32.43,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,{\i1}Oda Nobutaka.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:33.66,0:08:36.75,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,{\i1}He was the kind of guy who excelled at everything.
