Dialogue: 10,0:08:40.74,0:08:42.41,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,{\i1}He was good at sports.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:43.25,0:08:45.17,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,{\i1}He was nice to everyone,
Dialogue: 10,0:08:45.17,0:08:46.08,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,{\i1}had tons of friends...
Dialogue: 10,0:08:46.76,0:08:48.57,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,{\i1}The girls liked him, too.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:49.88,0:08:52.01,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,{\i1}Anything he did, he was great at.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:53.22,0:08:56.84,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,{\i1}When I was little, I wanted to be like that.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:57.44,0:08:59.89,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,{\i1}But I couldn't beat him at anything.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:00.78,0:09:02.85,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,{\i1}It got to the point where it gave me a complex.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:03.68,0:09:06.81,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,{\i1}For some reason, he talked to me a lot.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:08.58,0:09:10.86,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,{\i1}Maybe because we both had single mothers.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:10.86,0:09:12.99,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,{\i1}Anyway, we would often hang out.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:13.72,0:09:15.41,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,{\i1}He was fun to be with.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:16.46,0:09:20.13,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,{\i1}I thought I was the only one he was really open with.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:20.70,0:09:22.15,Default,Guy,0,0,0,,{\i1}So, I was open with him.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:24.56,0:09:27.54,Default,O,0,0,0,,You like Aiko?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:27.54,0:09:29.33,Default,S,0,0,0,,D-Don't tell anyone, okay?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:31.20,0:09:33.05,Default,S,0,0,0,,{\i1}I opened up to him.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:35.26,0:09:37.39,Default,O,0,0,0,,Well? Did you ask her out?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:37.39,0:09:39.26,Default,S,0,0,0,,Like I could.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:41.41,0:09:43.26,Default,O,0,0,0,,Serizawa Aiko, huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:43.74,0:09:46.31,Default,O,0,0,0,,She's kinda plain, but pretty cute, huh?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:47.52,0:09:49.23,Default,O,0,0,0,,Why don't you ask her out?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:49.23,0:09:51.37,Default,S,0,0,0,,I'm fine with things as they are.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:51.98,0:09:54.61,Default,S,0,0,0,,I can't just walk up to girls and ask them out like you.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:55.08,0:09:56.59,Default,O,0,0,0,,Idiot.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:56.59,0:09:58.61,Default,O,0,0,0,,You're gonna die a virgin.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:59.10,0:10:02.63,Default,O,0,0,0,,Seems to me like you're satisfied with holding yourself back.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:02.63,0:10:04.93,Default,O,0,0,0,,To me, you're like a gullible little kid.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:06.92,0:10:09.09,Default,O,0,0,0,,The first one to move wins.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:09.09,0:10:11.63,Default,O,0,0,0,,Stay on the defensive, and you'll lose your chance.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:12.08,0:10:15.63,Default,O,0,0,0,,Ryouta, that is the only difference between us,{This line was in the preview at the end of 09}
Dialogue: 10,0:10:16.28,0:10:19.23,Default,O,0,0,0,,regardless of whether you can understand that.{This line was in the preview at the end of 09}
Dialogue: 10,0:10:21.02,0:10:22.27,Default,S,0,0,0,,Buzz off.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:23.92,0:10:28.95,Default,S,0,0,0,,{\i1}I thought that only self-confident people could say that.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:30.28,0:10:34.31,Default,S,0,0,0,,{\i1}And he was, so he acted in kind.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:39.08,0:10:40.53,Default,Girls,0,0,0,,A-Aiko...
Dialogue: 10,0:10:40.53,0:10:41.57,Default,Girls,0,0,0,,What's wrong, Aiko?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:42.06,0:10:43.07,Default,Girls,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:43.07,0:10:44.95,Default,Girls,0,0,0,,What are you doing, Nobutaka?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:44.95,0:10:48.61,Default,Girls,0,0,0,,Weren't you dating me?!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:48.61,0:10:49.65,Default,O,0,0,0,,Shut your mouth.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:49.65,0:10:50.71,Default,Girl,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:50.71,0:10:52.53,Default,Girl,0,0,0,,Don't walk away from me, Nobutaka!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:57.84,0:10:59.35,Default,S,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:01.36,0:11:04.87,Default,O,0,0,0,,I feel bad about it.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:04.87,0:11:06.72,Default,S,0,0,0,,I asked you what happened!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:07.14,0:11:11.35,Default,O,0,0,0,,I did it with Aiko.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:15.30,0:11:16.19,Default,S,0,0,0,,Wha...
Dialogue: 10,0:11:16.19,0:11:17.77,Default,S,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:18.16,0:11:20.15,Default,O,0,0,0,,Aiko came and said she liked me.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:20.99,0:11:22.70,Default,O,0,0,0,,What's it to you?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:22.70,0:11:23.70,Default,O,0,0,0,,Not like you—
Dialogue: 10,0:11:28.72,0:11:29.71,Default,S,0,0,0,,{\i1}I...
Dialogue: 10,0:11:31.42,0:11:32.49,Default,S,0,0,0,,{\i1}I...
Dialogue: 10,0:11:37.00,0:11:38.51,Default,S,0,0,0,,{\i1}I was betrayed.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:39.09,0:11:41.15,Default,S,0,0,0,,{\i1}Humiliated.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:42.17,0:11:44.31,Default,S,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'd opened my heart to him.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:45.20,0:11:47.43,Default,S,0,0,0,,{\i1}He humiliated me!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:55.34,0:11:58.01,Default,S,0,0,0,,{\i1}Next thing I knew, I was surrounded by a bunch of people.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:00.02,0:12:02.39,Default,S,0,0,0,,{\i1}We were both suspended.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:02.39,0:12:04.53,Default,S,0,0,0,,{\i1}He quit school.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:06.02,0:12:08.07,Default,S,0,0,0,,{\i1}I heard he became a host.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:08.07,0:12:10.51,Default,S,0,0,0,,{\i1}Even ended up with his own club.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:12.00,0:12:13.85,Default,S,0,0,0,,{\i1}But none of that matters.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:15.30,0:12:18.19,Default,S,0,0,0,,{\i1}Why did he do something like that?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:19.80,0:12:22.33,Default,S,0,0,0,,{\i1}If I'd at least asked him that,
Dialogue: 10,0:12:22.33,0:12:24.37,Default,S,0,0,0,,{\i1}would it have satisfied me a bit?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:25.01,0:12:27.51,Default,O,0,0,0,,{\i1}The first one to move wins.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:28.00,0:12:30.26,Default,O,0,0,0,,{\i1}Are you Ryouta?{4:44}
Dialogue: 10,0:12:30.58,0:12:33.69,Default,S,0,0,0,,{\i1}So that really was Oda.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:34.66,0:12:35.77,Default,S,0,0,0,,{\i1}Knowing him,
Dialogue: 10,0:12:36.64,0:12:40.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}any number of people might have wanted him sent to this island.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:41.34,0:12:42.71,Default,S,0,0,0,,{\i1}But is he...
Dialogue: 10,0:12:44.14,0:12:46.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Is he going to be my enemy?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:59.60,0:13:00.84,Default,H,0,0,0,,That looks good.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:00.84,0:13:02.75,Default,S,0,0,0,,It's a makeshift curry gruel.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:02.75,0:13:04.41,Default,H,0,0,0,,I can't wait to have some.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:04.41,0:13:06.22,Default,S,0,0,0,,We have to let it steep a little more.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:07.14,0:13:08.53,Default,D,0,0,0,,{\i1}Damn it.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:08.53,0:13:12.85,Default,D,0,0,0,,{\i1}He didn't get the food and ended up running away like a coward.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:13.26,0:13:18.55,Default,D,0,0,0,,{\i1}And now, I have to share the little bit of food I have left?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:19.52,0:13:22.75,Default,D,0,0,0,,{\i1}I don't know why I even joined them!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:23.54,0:13:24.51,Default,S,0,0,0,,Mr. Date?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:26.96,0:13:30.15,Default,S,0,0,0,,I'm glad you found a trunk.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:30.70,0:13:33.87,Default,S,0,0,0,,We appreciate the food.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:33.87,0:13:34.97,Default,D,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:34.97,0:13:37.83,Default,D,0,0,0,,That first day, I was fortunate to get some.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:37.83,0:13:41.53,Default,D,0,0,0,,There isn't much left, but it should at least last another day.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:41.53,0:13:44.25,Default,D,0,0,0,,But tomorrow, we have to get more.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:45.34,0:13:47.13,Default,S,0,0,0,,Another carrier will come tomorrow?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:47.13,0:13:48.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, uh...
Dialogue: 10,0:13:48.83,0:13:51.15,Default,D,0,0,0,,{\i1}If I know too much, they'll get suspicious.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:51.64,0:13:53.64,Default,D,0,0,0,,Well, you see...
Dialogue: 10,0:13:54.20,0:13:58.17,Default,D,0,0,0,,Since I got some the first day, and I'm a bit cowardly,
Dialogue: 10,0:13:58.17,0:14:01.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I spent a lot of time thinking about the food.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:01.17,0:14:04.11,Default,D,0,0,0,,I heard that engine sound every day, at noon.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:04.11,0:14:06.49,Default,D,0,0,0,,So I'm sure there'll be a plane tomorrow, too.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:06.49,0:14:08.74,Default,S,0,0,0,,I get it. That's amazing.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:09.28,0:14:13.03,Default,S,0,0,0,,This'll make it a lot easier to get the food.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:16.34,0:14:17.75,Default,S,0,0,0,,It's ready.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:17.75,0:14:19.57,Default,S,0,0,0,,Mr. Taira, please have some.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:20.24,0:14:22.91,Default,S,0,0,0,,There isn't a lot, but I let it steep a long time.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:22.91,0:14:25.67,Default,S,0,0,0,,It doesn't have much flavor, but it'll fill you up.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:28.74,0:14:30.29,Default,T,0,0,0,,Thank you...
Dialogue: 10,0:14:30.29,0:14:33.76,Default,T,0,0,0,,but I'm not hungry.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:33.76,0:14:38.14,Default,S,0,0,0,,That's no good. You need to build up your strength to get better.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:38.74,0:14:40.55,Default,S,0,0,0,,Come on, just a little.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:41.52,0:14:42.65,Default,D,0,0,0,,May I?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:46.92,0:14:48.72,Default,D,0,0,0,,This is bad.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:48.72,0:14:52.43,Default,D,0,0,0,,The lizard's venom is keeping his wound from healing.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:53.26,0:14:55.31,Default,D,0,0,0,,We need some serum immediately.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:55.31,0:14:57.11,Default,D,0,0,0,,He requires proper treatment,
Dialogue: 10,0:14:57.11,0:14:58.66,Default,D,0,0,0,,or he'll die.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:59.16,0:15:01.25,Default,S,0,0,0,,But there's no way... {Even if you say that...}
Dialogue: 10,0:15:01.25,0:15:02.67,Default,H,0,0,0,,Ryouta.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:02.67,0:15:03.95,Default,H,0,0,0,,Can I have a word?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:03.95,0:15:04.99,Default,S,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:04.99,0:15:05.67,Default,S,0,0,0,,We're...
Dialogue: 10,0:15:05.67,0:15:07.37,Default,H,0,0,0,,Just come with me.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:07.37,0:15:09.95,Default,D,0,0,0,,I'll make sure he eats.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:11.52,0:15:12.43,Default,D,0,0,0,,Go on.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:13.27,0:15:14.53,Default,S,0,0,0,,Thanks.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:14.53,0:15:15.55,Default,S,0,0,0,,What's the problem, Himiko?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:18.94,0:15:20.89,Default,S,0,0,0,,Go back to that abandoned building?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:20.89,0:15:22.01,Default,H,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:22.01,0:15:26.43,Default,H,0,0,0,,Ms. Murasaki said there was a medicine supply.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:26.43,0:15:29.03,Default,H,0,0,0,,I'm sure we can find something there.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:29.03,0:15:30.47,Default,S,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:30.47,0:15:34.41,Default,S,0,0,0,,Whoever used that building before kept some in case of lizard bites.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:34.41,0:15:36.75,Default,S,0,0,0,,They {\i1}should{\i0} have some serum.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:37.36,0:15:39.05,Default,S,0,0,0,,And Mr. Date is a doctor.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:39.64,0:15:41.37,Default,S,0,0,0,,He should know what medicine we need.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:42.35,0:15:44.25,Default,H,0,0,0,,You're taking him with you?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:44.72,0:15:45.71,Default,S,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:45.71,0:15:48.59,Default,H,0,0,0,,Couldn't we ask Ms. Murasaki to give it to us?
Dialogue: 10,0:15:48.59,0:15:52.17,Default,S,0,0,0,,He's actually examined Mr. Taira,
Dialogue: 10,0:15:52.17,0:15:53.63,Default,,0,0,0,,so it'd be better if he got it.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:54.28,0:15:55.51,Default,H,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 10,0:16:00.52,0:16:02.02,Default,D,0,0,0,,Now, chew it slowly.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:02.42,0:16:04.72,Default,D,0,0,0,,Yes, like that.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:04.72,0:16:06.77,Default,D,0,0,0,,Slowly, slowly...
Dialogue: 10,0:16:06.77,0:16:07.83,Default,D,0,0,0,,{\i1}Damn it!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:10.10,0:16:13.70,Default,D,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm wasting valuable food on a man who's almost dead.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:13.70,0:16:17.15,Default,D,0,0,0,,{\i1}There's no point in working with them anymore.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:17.15,0:16:18.99,Default,D,0,0,0,,{\i1}I think it's time to say goodbye.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:19.74,0:16:21.70,Default,D,0,0,0,,Open your mouth.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:23.58,0:16:25.49,Default,D,0,0,0,,Yes, slowly.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:25.49,0:16:26.75,Default,D,0,0,0,,You're doing great.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:26.75,0:16:27.73,Default,S,0,0,0,,Mr. Date.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:27.73,0:16:28.46,Default,D,0,0,0,,Yes?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:29.24,0:16:31.79,Default,S,0,0,0,,We know where there might be medicine.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:31.79,0:16:33.39,Default,S,0,0,0,,Could you come with us?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:33.39,0:16:35.59,Default,D,0,0,0,,There's medicine here?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:35.98,0:16:39.71,Default,S,0,0,0,,I don't know if there's anything we can use to help Mr. Taira.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:39.71,0:16:41.22,Default,S,0,0,0,,But let's go take a look.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:41.90,0:16:44.21,Default,T,0,0,0,,S-Sakamoto...
Dialogue: 10,0:16:44.21,0:16:46.73,Default,T,0,0,0,,You're going to leave me again?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:46.73,0:16:49.05,Default,S,0,0,0,,I'll be back as soon as I can.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:11.28,0:17:13.79,Default,S,0,0,0,,You really hate Mr. Date that much?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:14.30,0:17:16.31,Default,H,0,0,0,,I just don't trust him.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:16.31,0:17:17.38,Default,H,0,0,0,,There's something off about him.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:17.72,0:17:19.31,Default,S,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 10,0:17:19.31,0:17:23.39,Default,S,0,0,0,,He seems like such a good person. It's hard to imagine him being sent here.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:23.39,0:17:25.53,Default,H,0,0,0,,He just acts that way.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:25.53,0:17:26.95,Default,H,0,0,0,,He's not really like that.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:27.66,0:17:28.89,Default,H,0,0,0,,Like what happened before.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:31.52,0:17:34.23,Default,H,0,0,0,,He tried to kill me with that girl.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:34.23,0:17:37.91,Default,H,0,0,0,,But he made it sound like he saved me.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:40.06,0:17:42.17,Default,H,0,0,0,,I can't trust him.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:42.17,0:17:43.49,Default,H,0,0,0,,And you, Ryouta...
Dialogue: 10,0:17:43.49,0:17:46.41,Default,H,0,0,0,,You told him we have three chips!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:47.76,0:17:50.00,Default,H,0,0,0,,I'm sure he plans to...
Dialogue: 10,0:17:51.10,0:17:52.25,Default,S,0,0,0,,Hey, Himiko.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:52.78,0:17:54.50,Default,S,0,0,0,,If we're going to survive on this island,
Dialogue: 10,0:17:54.50,0:17:57.33,Default,S,0,0,0,,I think it's important to trust people.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:58.20,0:18:02.33,Default,S,0,0,0,,And if you don't start by trusting them, they won't ever really trust you.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:04.00,0:18:08.63,Default,S,0,0,0,,We know he didn't use a single BIM until he met us.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:09.46,0:18:11.65,Default,S,0,0,0,,And he shared valuable food with us.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:12.56,0:18:15.40,Default,S,0,0,0,,I believe in him.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:17.04,0:18:18.15,Default,H,0,0,0,,That's enough.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:18.15,0:18:19.95,Default,H,0,0,0,,I won't bring it up again.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:20.92,0:18:22.51,Default,S,0,0,0,,W-Wait...
Dialogue: 10,0:18:23.70,0:18:27.09,Default,D,0,0,0,,Sakamoto, are we there yet?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:27.09,0:18:28.81,Default,S,0,0,0,,Almost.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:34.86,0:18:37.37,Default,D,0,0,0,,This is an old building.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:37.37,0:18:39.42,Default,D,0,0,0,,And it's big, too.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:39.74,0:18:42.81,Default,D,0,0,0,,I'm amazed you found a medicine supply here.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:44.46,0:18:46.31,Default,S,0,0,0,,Do you know where it is?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:46.31,0:18:47.43,Default,H,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:48.56,0:18:51.57,Default,H,0,0,0,,I was going to ask Ms. Murasaki.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:51.57,0:18:53.05,Default,S,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:53.05,0:18:56.51,Default,S,0,0,0,,We should keep the fact that she lives here a secret, right?
Dialogue: 10,0:18:56.51,0:18:57.71,Default,H,0,0,0,,Of course!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:58.52,0:19:00.19,Default,D,0,0,0,,Is something wrong?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:00.95,0:19:02.37,Default,S,0,0,0,,N-No.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:02.37,0:19:04.71,Default,S,0,0,0,,It sounds like she doesn't know exactly where it is.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:04.71,0:19:06.20,Default,S,0,0,0,,We'll look for it.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:06.20,0:19:08.25,Default,D,0,0,0,,You don't know where it is?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:08.86,0:19:12.71,Default,D,0,0,0,,Then how do you know it's here?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:13.46,0:19:15.11,Default,S,0,0,0,,Um, that's...
Dialogue: 10,0:19:15.11,0:19:15.85,Default,H,0,0,0,,{\i1}Crap.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:16.44,0:19:18.37,Default,H,0,0,0,,L-Last time, I got lost in here.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:18.37,0:19:20.59,Default,H,0,0,0,,I don't remember which way I went.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:21.02,0:19:23.18,Default,H,0,0,0,,I get lost easily.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:23.18,0:19:24.35,Default,S,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:24.35,0:19:25.55,Default,S,0,0,0,,She's kind of dim.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:25.55,0:19:27.10,Default,H,0,0,0,,I didn't say that!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:27.98,0:19:29.10,Default,D,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:29.10,0:19:32.85,Default,D,0,0,0,,Then it would be better to split up and search.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:32.85,0:19:34.97,Default,S,0,0,0,,Then I'll take the second floor.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:34.97,0:19:36.91,Default,H,0,0,0,,I'll check the annex.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:36.91,0:19:39.69,Default,S,0,0,0,,Send two radar pings if you find it.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:39.69,0:19:40.77,Default,D,0,0,0,,Understood.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:53.72,0:19:55.79,Default,D,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm back here?
Dialogue: 10,0:19:56.40,0:19:58.80,Default,D,0,0,0,,{\i1}Nothing has changed in six months.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:59.68,0:20:01.73,Default,D,0,0,0,,{\i1}These maze-like hallways...
Dialogue: 10,0:20:02.68,0:20:05.80,Default,D,0,0,0,,{\i1}little windows to toss bombs through.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:06.28,0:20:10.67,Default,D,0,0,0,,{\i1}It's almost like the ones in charge {\i0}wanted{\i1} us to fight here.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:10.67,0:20:11.56,Default,D,0,0,0,,{\i1}The bastards!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:14.16,0:20:18.29,Default,D,0,0,0,,{\i1}The medicine here won't do anyone any good.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:18.29,0:20:20.57,Default,D,0,0,0,,{\i1}Most of it's long past its expiration date.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:21.06,0:20:23.85,Default,D,0,0,0,,{\i1}There's no way I can find a usable serum here either.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:27.22,0:20:29.75,Default,D,0,0,0,,{\i1}But it doesn't matter.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:30.26,0:20:33.79,Default,D,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'll just toss in some bottles. That'll be enough.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:40.75,0:20:42.21,Default,S,0,0,0,,Mr. Date?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:42.21,0:20:43.79,Default,S,0,0,0,,You've already found it?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:44.76,0:20:49.51,Default,D,0,0,0,,Yes, I stocked up on some tools and medicines I can use.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:50.26,0:20:52.27,Default,S,0,0,0,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:53.92,0:20:58.65,Default,D,0,0,0,,Sakamoto, do you doubt me?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:59.76,0:21:03.31,Default,D,0,0,0,,I overheard your conversation with that girl.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:03.31,0:21:04.65,Default,D,0,0,0,,Just so we're clear,
Dialogue: 10,0:21:05.06,0:21:08.85,Default,,0,0,0,,you can't survive here without mutual trust.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:08.85,0:21:11.13,Default,D,0,0,0,,I want to believe in you guys.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:11.13,0:21:13.04,Default,D,0,0,0,,And I want you to believe in me.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:13.04,0:21:15.09,Default,S,0,0,0,,I... understand.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:15.09,0:21:16.27,Default,S,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:16.27,0:21:18.75,Default,D,0,0,0,,Okay, hold on to this on the way back.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:18.75,0:21:20.29,Default,S,0,0,0,,R-Right.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:23.96,0:21:26.25,Default,D,0,0,0,,It has important materials inside.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:26.25,0:21:27.87,Default,D,0,0,0,,Be careful with it.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:27.87,0:21:29.15,Default,S,0,0,0,,I-I will.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:31.93,0:21:32.96,Default,S,0,0,0,,{\i1}Wh-Why's he...
Dialogue: 10,0:21:33.48,0:21:35.29,Default,S,0,0,0,,{\i1}so intimidating?
Dialogue: 10,0:21:36.36,0:21:39.89,Default,O,0,0,0,,{\i1}To me, you're like a gullible little kid.{10:00}
Dialogue: 10,0:21:40.64,0:21:42.98,Default,H,0,0,0,,{\i1}I'm sure he plans to...{17:48}
Dialogue: 10,0:21:43.82,0:21:45.41,Default,D,0,0,0,,Now, let's hurry.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:46.08,0:21:47.99,Default,S,0,0,0,,We have to call Himiko, first.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:47.99,0:21:50.62,Default,D,0,0,0,,Ah. We do, don't we?
Dialogue: 10,0:21:57.08,0:21:58.79,Default,S,0,0,0,,{\i1}Why is she running?
Dialogue: 10,0:22:02.71,0:22:03.84,Default,H,0,0,0,,Ryouta!
Dialogue: 10,0:22:03.84,0:22:05.15,Default,S,0,0,0,,Oh, Himiko.
Dialogue: 10,0:22:05.15,0:22:07.23,Default,S,0,0,0,,We found the medicine.
Dialogue: 10,0:22:09.80,0:22:12.18,Default,H,0,0,0,,Ryouta, get rid of the trunk!
Dialogue: 10,0:22:13.60,0:22:15.18,Default,H,0,0,0,,Hurry! Throw it away!
Dialogue: 10,0:22:15.82,0:22:17.48,Default,D,0,0,0,,{\i1}That woman...
Dialogue: 10,0:22:17.48,0:22:18.68,Default,S,0,0,0,,Wh-Why?
Dialogue: 10,0:22:19.02,0:22:20.69,Default,H,0,0,0,,Just do it!
Dialogue: 10,0:22:20.69,0:22:22.44,Default,H,0,0,0,,The trunk's got a BIM...
Dialogue: 10,0:22:22.44,0:22:24.44,Default,H,0,0,0,,There's a bomb inside it!
Dialogue: 10,0:22:25.06,0:22:26.65,Default,S,0,0,0,,Wh-What?!
Dialogue: 10,0:22:28.65,0:22:29.49,Default,D,0,0,0,,{\i1}Die.
Dialogue: 10,0:22:30.49,0:22:32.62,Default,H,0,0,0,,Ryouta!
