Dialogue: 10,0:24:09.22,0:24:10.78,Default,Preview,0,0,0,,He's dead!
Dialogue: 10,0:24:10.78,0:24:14.78,Default,Preview,0,0,0,,Now it's just the stupid schoolgirl and the dying cripple.
Dialogue: 10,0:24:14.78,0:24:16.56,Default,Preview,0,0,0,,I'll get all the chips I need again!
Dialogue: 10,0:24:17.13,0:24:20.82,Default,Preview,0,0,0,,{\an8}The one to survive will be me, Date Masahito.
